<div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-3">API Authentication</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Every AI endpoint requires an active API key. Send the key in the <code>X-API-Key</code> request header over HTTPS. Keys are managed from the developer portal and are only shown in full immediately after creation.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Provisioning Key Tokens</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center text-white bg-slate-900">1</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Sign in through the <a href="/auth/central" class="underline font-medium" style="color: #111CA8;">developer portal</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center text-white bg-slate-900">2</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Open <strong>API Keys</strong> and create a key for your application.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center text-white bg-slate-900">3</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Choose a name, permissions, and optional per-key limits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 flex gap-3">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center text-white bg-slate-900">4</span>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 font-semibold text-slate-900">Copy the generated key before closing. It cannot be retrieved later; create a replacement if it is lost.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Header Reference Schema</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Populate downstream operational request executions using standard key headers:</p>
    
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl -X POST https://aiservice.prabisha.com/chat \
  -H "X-API-Key: your-api-key-here" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello!"}]
  }'</code></pre>

    <div class="border-l-4 p-4 my-6 rounded-r-xl bg-orange-50/60 border-orange-500">
        <p class="text-orange-950 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle mr-2 text-orange-600"></i>
            <strong>Security:</strong> Do not expose secret API keys in browser code or commit them to source control. Call the gateway from a trusted server and store the key in a secret manager or environment variable.
        </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">API Key Scopes Matrix</h2>
    <div class="overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-slate-200 text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-slate-50">
                <tr>
                    <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-700">Scope Type</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-slate-700">Downstream Queue Access Route Target</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-slate-600 bg-white">
                <tr>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">CHAT</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3">Scope metadata is configurable in the portal. Endpoint authorization currently validates the key status; it does not enforce individual scope values.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">IMAGE</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3">Do not use scope metadata as a security boundary until endpoint-level scope enforcement is enabled.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">VIDEO</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3">Video generation is not currently enabled.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">EMBEDDINGS</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-3">Embedding requests require a valid active API key.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>